# Deny everything, then allow only what the image build actually consumes.
# Keeping this tight stops .git and local state from entering the build
# context.
*
!image/
!image/**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!bin/dinosay
# The skills generator runs at build time to project the org's docs/skills
# manifest into Goose's native Agent Skills layout.
!scripts/generate-skills.py
# The SBOM manifest generator runs at build time to record archive-installed
# components as an SPDX document inside the image.
!scripts/generate-sbom-manifest.py
# The appliance build stage generates its own SPDX document for the four
# archives it fetches (omp, node, pi, gh) plus the review mode itself.
!scripts/generate-appliance-sbom.py
# The isolated contributor image writes its own minimal component manifest.
!scripts/generate-contribute-sbom.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
